ters \u304c\u7a81\u7136\u30ea\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u3055\u308c\u308b", "content_html": "Runbook: show interfaces counters \u304c\u7a81\u7136\u30ea\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u3055\u308c\u308b\u969b\u306e\u5207\u308a\u5206\u3051\u624b\u9806\u3002portstat \u306e\u5dee\u5206 cache (/tmp/cache/portstat/) \u55aa\u5931\u30fbsonic-clear counters \u306e\u8aa4\u5b9f\u884c\u30fbsyncd \u518d\u8d77\u52d5\u3092\u9806\u306b\u78ba\u8a8d\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/interface-counters-reset.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T20:25:37+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T08:51:54+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/sai-failure/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/sai-failure/", "title": "SAI failure / syncd \u30ea\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u30c8\u591a\u767a", "content_html": "syncd \u306e\u7570\u5e38\u7d42\u4e86\u3084 SAI API \u9023\u7d9a\u5931\u6557\u3092\u5207\u308a\u5206\u3051\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306e runbook\u3002CRM \u67af\u6e07 / SDK \u975e\u5bfe\u5fdc\u5c5e\u6027 / object \u524a\u9664\u9806\u5e8f / OOM / HW \u969c\u5bb3\u3092\u9806\u306b\u78ba\u8a8d\u3059\u308b\u624b\u9806\u3092\u307e\u3068\u3081\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/sai-failure.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T20:25:37+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T06:30:01+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/", "title": "HLD \u3068\u5b9f\u88c5\u306e\u4e56\u96e2 \u4e00\u89a7\uff08discrepancy-index\uff09", "content_html": "HLD \u3068\u5b9f\u88c5\u306e\u4e56\u96e2 \u4e00\u89a7\uff08discrepancy-index\uff09 \u2014 verification: discrepancy-found \u